WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.800
[soft music]

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:03.979
Welcome.

3
00:00:03.979 --> 00:00:08.176
This lesson is about the future of virtual assistant work.

4
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:15.656
Technology and remote work are changing how virtual assistants work.

5
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:22.488
Artificial intelligence can do simple, repeated tasks quickly.

6
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:30.376
But clients still value people who think, communicate and solve problems.

7
00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:36.812
Trust, reliability and good judgement matter more and more.

8
00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:42.849
If you want to become an assistant, learn to use AI tools.

9
00:00:42.849 --> 00:00:44.100
Do not fear them.

10
00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:50.812
So the future of virtual assistant work is promising for people who keep learning.

11
00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:54.980
[music ends]
